  "worked_solution": "The formula for the area of a circle is\n\n$$\nA=\\pi {r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the radius $r=3,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\  & =\\pi \\cdot {3}^{2} \\\\  & =9\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
